{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名電腦愛好者近日展示了一項頗具創意的家庭實驗：他將一台已經損壞的微星筆記本電腦徹底拆解，只保留主板、內存和存儲設備，然後直接安裝在牆壁上，將其改造成一台全天候運行的家庭伺服器，用於控制住宅中的照明、空調、窗簾和風扇等智能設備。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585432.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.668029+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:28:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"ed6544dafd1d5a1dc0134e61de6e28cc0c893e7c9c6e29bea3eca5ac1fdffcd4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}